var DATA = {"script": {"id": "1OnxBRiIg-9a8PKmah0Ani9zUF0RS0fGpLmVhh5A1xsk", "pairs": [[" before you read on, or keep it open next to this email. Jordan sells to beginners who want to make money online. You probably don't. So at the end, I'll show you how to take the same skeleton and use it for a consulting or service business, plus a template you can fill in this week.", " before you read on, or keep it open next to this email. Jordan sells to beginners who want to make money online, and you probably don't, so at the end I'll show you how to take the same skeleton and use it for a consulting or service business, plus a template you can fill in this week."], ["Here are a few of the people we've worked with:", "A few of the people we've worked with:"], ["Jordan is one of those clients. Here's how we worked together.", "Jordan is one of those clients, and this is how we worked together."], ["He already had views when he came to us. What he didn't have was time. He was spending hours scripting every video himself, and he'd already hired other scriptwriters who couldn't make a script sound like him.", "He already had views when he came to us, but he didn't have time. He was spending hours scripting every video himself, and he'd already hired other scriptwriters who couldn't make a script sound like him."], ["We wrote the script. We didn't film it, edit it, or run Jordan's funnel, so I don't have a sales number for this video and I'm not going to make one up. The $16,740 is an AdSense estimate from Nexlev, not a payout screenshot.", "We wrote the script, but we didn't film it, edit it or run Jordan's funnel, so I don't have a sales number for this video and I'm not going to make one up. The $16,740 is an AdSense estimate from Nexlev, and I don't have a payout screenshot for it."], ["Every step follows the same pattern. First, an open loop, which is a line that makes you curious about what's coming next. Then the why, the what and the how. I'll explain each one as we hit it.", "Every step follows the same pattern. It starts with an open loop, which is a line that makes you curious about what's coming next, and then gives the why, the what and the how. I'll explain each one as we hit it."], [" This video is a mini sales video for $37 program, Digital Launchpad, which Jordan runs with Iman Gadzhi. So every step had to do two jobs: help the viewer for free, and make the program feel like the obvious next move.", " This video is a mini sales video for a $37 program, Digital Launchpad, which Jordan runs with Iman Gadzhi. So every step had to do two jobs: help the viewer for free, and make the program feel like the obvious next move."], ["Now, you might be thinking: \"Bryan, my video isn't selling a $37 course.\" That's fine. Yours is selling a call, a service or a program. The job is the same. Keep reading.", "Now, you might be thinking: \"Bryan, my video isn't selling a $37 course.\" That's fine, because yours is selling a call, a service or a program, and the job is the same, so keep reading."], ["And it does it with a before and after. Completely broke, then $10 million. Proof is the fastest way to switch off a viewer's BS detector. And it has to be specific, because people assume you're telling the truth when you give them a real number.", "It does it with a before and after: completely broke, then $10 million. Proof is the fastest way to switch off a viewer's BS detector, and it has to be specific, because people assume you're telling the truth when you give them a real number."], ["Now the script goes low on purpose. For the next couple of minutes, Jordan paints a picture of the average person. A boring 9 to 5, no goals, money spent on stupid stuff, 4 hours a night scrolling social media.", "Now the script goes low on purpose. For the next couple of minutes, Jordan paints a picture of the average person: a boring 9 to 5, no goals, money spent on stupid stuff and 4 hours a night scrolling social media."], [" Without that line, the 