iling fast, because only people who are already shopping will click."], ["Ideas built on something you did beat ideas that only teach. I'll come back to this in Step 3, because it's the whole reason the unique advantage matters.", "Ideas built on something you did beat ideas that only teach. I'll come back to this in Step 3, because it's why the unique advantage matters."], ["I don't brainstorm ideas. I steal formats. I'm not stealing anyone's video, I'm adapting what already works.", "When I need ideas, I steal formats. That means taking a title shape that already worked and adapting it, without copying anyone's video."], ["Their channel size → Counts as a win at", "(Their channel size, and what counts as a win)"], ["Under 10,000 subscribers → ", "Under 10,000 subscribers: "], ["10,000 to 100,000 → ", "10,000 to 100,000: "], ["100,000 to 250,000 → ", "100,000 to 250,000: "], ["250,000 and up → ", "250,000 and up: "], ["The age of the video doesn't matter much. Leila's first one was about two years old when we used it. What matters is whether recent videos using the same format are still doing well. If you see a format everywhere and the newest ones are flopping, people are tired of it, so skip it for a few months.", "The age of the video doesn't matter much, and Leila's first one was about two years old when we used it. Check whether recent videos using the same format are still doing well. If you see a format everywhere and the newest ones are flopping, people are tired of it, so skip it for a few months."], [" This is where Inayah's format came from. Leila has a big female audience, and so does Inayah. Same audience, same psychology, so the same title shape pulls the same people.", " This is where Inayah's format came from. Leila has a big female audience, and so does Inayah. With the same audience and the same psychology, the same title shape pulls the same people."], [" Our example: How I Brainwashed Myself to Be a Millionaire at 20 (1,203,773 views) · Your ver