y, Actually", " Our example: getting rich is easy, actually (923,776 views). Your version: Closing Big Clients Is Easy, Actually"], [" Our example: Full YouTube Script Writing Course (1+ Hour) (312,439 views) · Your version: Full B2B Sales Course (2 Hours)", " Our example: Full YouTube Script Writing Course (1+ Hour) (312,439 views). Your version: Full B2B Sales Course (2 Hours)"], [" Our example: How to Start an Ecommerce Business in 2025 (FREE COURSE) (447,211 views) · Your version: How To Start A Bookkeeping Business In 2027 (Free Course)", " Our example: How to Start an Ecommerce Business in 2025 (FREE COURSE) (447,211 views). Your version: How To Start A Bookkeeping Business In 2027 (Free Course)"], [" Our example: If You Understand Math, You Understand Trading (3 booked calls in 5 days) · Your version: If You Understand Your Bank Statement, You Understand Your Business", " Our example: If You Understand Math, You Understand Trading (3 booked calls in 5 days). Your version: If You Understand Your Bank Statement, You Understand Your Business"], ["Two things to notice. First, a lot of the formats that made money have a real number or a real result in them, which only works if it's true for you. Second, the videos that booked the most calls weren't always the ones with the most views. Scott's \"If You Understand Math\" video was him drawing on an iPad with no editing, and it booked 3 calls in its first 5 days.", "There are two things to notice. First, a lot of the formats that made money have a real number or a real result in them, which only works if it's true for you. Second, the videos that booked the most calls weren't always the ones with the most views. Scott's \"If You Understand Math\" video was him drawing on an iPad with no editing, and it booked 3 calls in its first 5 days."], ["So I asked what Inayah could say that nobody else in her niche could. The answer was her age. Lots of people claim to be millionaires. Very few can say they did it at 20. She al