n Again In 2027, I'd Do This; ___ Is Easy, Actually: Hiring Great Salespeople Is Easy, Actually; I Finally Revealed My ___ (For Free): I Finally Revealed My Sales Hiring Test (For Free)"], [" If I Started ___ Again In 2027: If I Set My Prices Again In 2027, I'd Do This · ___ Is Easy, Actually: Raising Your Prices Is Easy, Actually · I Finally Revealed My ___ (For Free): I Finally Revealed My Pricing Sheet (For Free)", " If I Started ___ Again In 2027: If I Set My Prices Again In 2027, I'd Do This; ___ Is Easy, Actually: Raising Your Prices Is Easy, Actually; I Finally Revealed My ___ (For Free): I Finally Revealed My Pricing Sheet (For Free)"], ["Some of those boxes are weak, and that's fine. You're not trying to make every box a video. You're trying to find the 3 that make you think \"I'd click that\".", "Some of those boxes are weak, and that's fine. The goal is to find the 3 that make you think \"I'd click that\"."], ["Then add your unique advantage to those 3. \"Cold Calling Is Easy, Actually\" becomes \"I've Trained 40 Sales Teams. Cold Calling Is Easy, Actually.\" Now it's yours.", "Then add your unique advantage to those 3 to make them yours. \"Cold Calling Is Easy, Actually\" becomes \"I've Trained 40 Sales Teams. Cold Calling Is Easy, Actually.\""], ["Reach videos bring new people in. Wider topic, bigger promise. Inayah's money mindset video is a reach video.", "Reach videos bring new people in with a wider topic and a bigger promise. Inayah's money mindset video is a reach video."], ["Sales videos turn watchers into buyers. A topic close to your offer, with real depth. Clover's \"Stupid Simple\" strategy video is a sales video.", "Sales videos turn watchers into buyers with a topic close to your offer and real depth. Clover's \"Stupid Simple\" strategy video is a sales video."], ["And to find out which videos actually sell, ask every new lead which video they watched. Write it down. After a month, that list will tell you more than your view counts.", "And 