ap camera look expensive."], ["Record your screen with Tella, not OBS. It crashes way less.", "Record your screen with Tella instead of OBS, because it crashes way less."], ["Hate all of this? Rent a studio for $100 to $200 an hour and walk in with nothing but your script.", "If you hate all of this, rent a studio for $100 to $200 an hour and walk in with nothing but your script."], ["Don't Want To Set Anything Up? Rent A Studio.", "If You Don't Want To Set Anything Up, Rent A Studio."], ["Here are a few of the people we've worked with:", "A few of the people we've worked with:"], ["Now, you might be thinking: \"Bryan, which setup is the best one?\"", "A lot of people ask me which setup is the best one."], ["There isn't one. Every creator will tell you their gear is the best, and you can lose weeks going down that rabbit hole. Pick a setup that fits your budget, learn it, and get a little better every video. Your first video doesn't need to look like a Netflix show.", "There isn't a best one. Every creator will tell you their gear is the best, and you can lose weeks going down that rabbit hole. Pick a setup that fits your budget, learn it, and get a little better every video. Your first video doesn't need to look like a Netflix show."], [" before you read on, decide which budget you're working with. Under $200, around $2,500, or $8,000 and up.", " before you read on, decide which budget you're working with: under $200, around $2,500, or $8,000 and up."], ["Here are the three setups side by side. Every product in this email has an Amazon link next to it, and the prices are what they cost in October 2026, so check them before you buy.", "These are the three setups side by side. Every product in this email has an Amazon link next to it, and the prices are what they cost in October 2026, so check them before you buy."], ["My first video took me 5 hours to film 10 minutes of footage. It got 20,000 views and brought in my first paying clients. I shot it on an iPhone.", "My first video took me 5 hours to film 10 minutes of footage. It got 20,000 views and brought in my first paying clients, and I shot it on an iPhone."], ["No budget at all? Sit facing a window during the day. The window is your light, and it's free.", "If you have no budget at all, sit facing a window during the day. The window is your light, and it's free."], ["Use the back camera, not the selfie camera. It's a lot sharper.", "Use the back camera instead of the selfie camera, because it's a lot sharper."], ["Make sure you have at least 20 GB free. 4K eats storage fast.", "Make sure you have at least 20 GB free, because 4K eats storage fast."], ["The dummy battery plugs into the wall so the camera never dies mid-take. The new ZV-E10 II uses the bigger NP-FZ100 battery, so make sure you buy the FZ100 version, not the old one.", "The dummy battery plugs into the wall so the camera never dies mid-take. The new ZV-E10 II uses the bigger NP-FZ100 battery, so make sure you buy the FZ100 version instead of the old one."], ["The MV7+ plugs into your computer with one cable. No audio interface, no extra boxes. It sounds close to the SM7B in the Premium setup for a lot less hassle.", "The MV7+ plugs into your computer with one cable, with no audio interface or extra boxes. It sounds close to the SM7B in the Premium setup for a lot less hassle."], ["This is for when YouTube is a real part of your business and you have a room you can leave set up. Two cameras, a proper studio light, and the mic you see on every podcast.", "This is for when YouTube is a real part of your business and you have a room you can leave set up. You get two cameras, a proper studio light, and the mic you see on every podcast."], ["This works for every budget. Same steps whether you're on an iPhone or an FX3.", "This works for every budget, and the steps are the same whether you're on an iPhone or an FX3."], ["Two rules. Your eyes should sit on the top third of the frame, and you should be dead centre. Ca