on YouTube."], ["One warning.", "Watch out for updates."], [".) Now that you have the animation system, the rest of the edit is the easy part. First, the cuts: removing the bad takes, the filler words, the ums and the silences. A normal editor spends around 3 hours on this. With AI it takes minutes.", ".) Now that you have the animation system, the rest of the edit is the easy part. First come the cuts: removing the bad takes, the filler words, the ums and the silences. A normal editor spends around 3 hours on this, and with AI it takes minutes."], ["The route I recommend: Gling.", "I recommend Gling."], ["The other route: have Claude cut it.", "The other option is to have Claude cut it."], ["To be honest, it can be a fight. I once spent two hours going back and forth and didn't get there. If you're new, use Gling.", "It can be a fight, though. I once spent two hours going back and forth and didn't get there. If you're new, use Gling."], [".) My tip here is that less is more.", ".) My tip here is to use fewer transitions than you think you need."], [".) This is where AI hits a limit. I've given it a whole library of sound effects, but right now it's only good if you pick the music for it. Knowing what good music and good effects are is still a human job, and you need licences. So I do it by hand.", ".) This is where AI hits a limit. I've given it a whole library of sound effects, but right now it's only good if you pick the music for it. Knowing what good music and good effects are is still a human job, and you need licences, so I do it by hand."], ["Here are the rules we use at the agency:", "These are the rules we use at the agency:"], ["Only put sound effects on the moments that matter. Not on every camera move.", "Save sound effects for the moments that matter instead of putting one on every camera move."], ["And that's a full video, edited with AI.", "That's the last step of the edit."], ["Most of the examples above came from creator channels. You don't need a 